before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <assert.h>
static int accept(int minutes) {
    if (minutes < 0) return 0;
    assert(minutes >= 0);
    return 1;
}
int main(void) {
    printf("%d\n", accept(-1));
    return 0;
}
```

